// src/v4/workflow/lens_ci_gate.dag
//
// Minimal lens-CI claim-run transport authority.
//
// History: extracted verbatim from the deleted `v4.workflow.ci` model (`src/v4/workflow/ci.dag`).
// That ~6,300-line model was a descriptive-only CI mirror with no runtime consumer (see
// docs/planning/thin-shim-ci-a3-runall-blocker-report-2026-06-08.md) and was deleted wholesale per
// operator GO. The only fragment with a real consumer is this lens-CI claim-run roster: the must-pass
// `v4_lens_ci` CI job (`scripts/v4-lens-ci-gate.sh`) text-projects this list and `*_count` to drive
// its discriminating, perturb-checked witnesses. `.github/workflows/ci.yml` is the direct hand-edited
// CI authority; this file owns only the lens claim-run roster the gate consumes.
//
// Roster discipline: every row below was MEASURED discriminating-green by
// `scripts/v4-lens-ci-gate.sh --perturb-check` (the witness returns Bool true under
// `gunbc run --claim-run`, AND fails when its body is perturbed to `false`). Vacuous
// greens (pass-under-perturb) are NOT wired. Re-measure before adding/removing rows.

module v4.workflow.lens_ci_gate

// M2 Lens-CI claim-run transport authority. The live shell gate projects this list;
// it does not own a parallel witness roster.
type LensCiClaimRunRow {
  label: String
  entry: String
  function: String
}

data lens_ci_claim_run_row_affected_set__edit_locus_affected_set_wire_holds: LensCiClaimRunRow = LensCiClaimRunRow {
